data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\varphi,A,L,s_M,s_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\">\\(M,N,\\varphi,A,L,s_M,s_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\subseteq V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_L:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9AbsolutenessPredicate}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9AbsolutenessPredicate}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}absoluteness\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9AbsolutenessPredicate}_S(M,N,\\varphi,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\n\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl({}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\cap\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s_M,s_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_M)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land s_M\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\n=s_N\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}\\bigl(s_M\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\subseteq A\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s_M)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,s_N)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}absoluteness\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9AbsolutenessPredicate}_S(M,N,\\varphi,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\n\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl({}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(N,L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\cap\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s_M,s_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_M)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(N,s_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land s_M\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\n=s_N\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}\\bigl(s_M\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\subseteq A\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s_M)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,s_N)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The language and both recursively validated satisfaction relations are bound explicitly.  The compared assignments are full assignments of their respective structures, agree on the actual free variables, and assign those variables values in the common parameter set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The former expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in A^{\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)}\">\\(s\\in A^{\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)}\\)</span> was only a partial assignment and therefore did not meet the upstream satisfaction predicate's assignment signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"